' A real, ordinary ArcoBASIC program meant to be compiled BY the Fission
' Compiler Substrate's native x86-64 backend (fission/amir/lower_x86_64.abas)
' -- see fission/tests/native_programs/hello_native.abas's own header
' comment for the directory convention. Exercises the THIRD real batch of
' host-function-bridge coverage: real File I/O
' (fission/native_runtime/host_bridge.c's own "Batch 3" section), reached
' via real raw Linux x86-64 syscalls (open/read/write/close/lseek/stat/
' mkdir/access/chmod), not libc. This is the FIRST batch to touch a real
' ArcoBASIC Array value at all through the host bridge: File.ReadBytes
' produces one, File.WriteBytes consumes one, both using the exact same
' array layout (an 8-byte element-count header, then N raw 8-byte element
' slots) this backend's own `array_alloc` subroutine already establishes,
' just allocated through a separate mmap'd block -- feasible without any
' array-representation overhaul because every array involved has a real
' size known BEFORE allocation (a file's own real byte length via lseek,
' or an array this program already built and never grows).
'
' Uses temp-file paths under /tmp, matching a real, disclosed test-only
' constraint (a real filesystem side effect, not a hermetic in-memory
' fixture like every other native_programs/*.abas fixture) -- deliberately
' idempotent (Directory.Create is real mkdir -p, safe to re-run;
' File.WriteText truncates, safe to re-run too).
'
' Expected output verified against legacy `ArcoFission compile-run` on this
' identical source as the equivalence-testing oracle.
p = "/tmp/arco_native_host_bridge_files_test.txt"
PRINT File.Exists(p)
ok = File.WriteText(p, "Hello")
PRINT ok
PRINT File.Exists(p)
PRINT File.ReadText(p)
ok2 = File.AppendText(p, ", World")
PRINT ok2
PRINT File.ReadText(p)
PRINT File.SetExecutable(p)

bytes = File.ReadBytes(p)
PRINT LEN(bytes)
PRINT bytes[0]
PRINT bytes[1]

p2 = "/tmp/arco_native_host_bridge_files_test_out.bin"
ok3 = File.WriteBytes(p2, bytes)
PRINT ok3
PRINT File.ReadText(p2)

d = "/tmp/arco_native_host_bridge_files_test_dir/nested"
PRINT Directory.Exists(d)
PRINT Directory.Create(d)
PRINT Directory.Exists(d)
